1. Install MetaMask extension from:
https://metamask.io

2. Open MetaMask and click "Create New Wallet".

3. Create wallet using Gmail or Secret Recovery Phrase.

4. Set and confirm a strong password.

5. Save the Secret Recovery Phrase securely.

6. Open:
https://chainlist.org

7. Connect MetaMask wallet to Chainlist.

8. Search for "Ethereum Sepolia".

9. Click "Add to MetaMask".

10. Open Sepolia Faucet:
https://cloud.google.com/application/web3/faucet/ethereum/sepolia

11. Copy wallet address from MetaMask.

12. Paste wallet address into faucet website.

13. Receive Sepolia ETH.

14. Open MetaMask and click "Send".

15. Enter receiver wallet address and ETH amount.

16. Confirm transaction.

17. Verify successful transaction in Activity tab.
